@startuml   Diagrama De Secuencia DataServer
participant Client
participant Server
participant EncryptionHandler
participant Crypter
participant IDistributionRandomSolver
participant NormalDistribution
participant UniformDistribution
participant Sockets
Client -> Server: POST /public_key
Server --> Client: 200 OK
Client -> Server: POST /numbers
Server --> Client: 201 OK with encrypted data
Client -> Crypter: decrypt(encrypted_data)
Crypter --> Client: decrypted_data
Client -> IDistributionRandomSolver: generate_numbers(min, max, count)
IDistributionRandomSolver -> NormalDistribution: generate_numbers(min, max, count)
NormalDistribution --> IDistributionRandomSolver: numbers, distribution
IDistributionRandomSolver --> Client: numbers, distribution
Client -> Crypter: encrypt(numbers, distribution)
Crypter --> Client: encrypted_result
Client -> Server: POST /numbers with encrypted_result
Server --> Client: 201 OK
@enduml
